# Files excluded from the published site: not served, not indexed for search,
# skipped by broken-link checks. Uses .gitignore syntax. Mintlify already
# auto-ignores .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, .vscode, node_modules,
# and README.md; .mintlify/ is never served. Everything below is additional.

# Planning + audit workspace — Markdown here would otherwise be reachable by URL
ia-audit/

