timezones-draft.mdx

# Repo tooling and dev-environment config (never rendered pages; excluded so the
# built tree and search index contain only docs)
scripts/
.mcp.json
.markdownlint.yaml
flake.nix
flake.lock

# Agents
## context entry points at root (symlinks into .mintlify/) — real .md
## files as far as the build is concerned, so they'd publish as hidden pages
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
## config dirs
.agents/
.claude/
## the IA rules and skills our agents read — never served, but the link checker
